 "final_summary": "The bug was caused by a non-atomic read-modify-write operation in the `next()` method that allowed race conditions under concurrent requests. The fix ensures atomicity by using `self._next += 1` within a locked block, guaranteeing unique ticket numbers under concurrent requests.",
